  "body": "## What changed\n- Added crafted B-rep record provocations in `crates/kernel/tests/machining_mesh_shortfalls.rs` that reach every `PlanStats` refusal (`FaceLeftOut`, `Lenient`, `EdgeNotSampled`, `FaceCapped`, `EdgeCapped`) and both capped-within-tolerance notes directly through `camcraft_kernel::machining_mesh::machining_mesh`.\n- Switched non-analytic face deviation (`Spline`, `RationalSpline`, `PlacedRevolution`) from fixed-parameter distance to orthogonal projection onto `EvalSurface` (`Deviation::projected` via `uv::project_with`) in `crates/kernel/src/mesh_bound.rs` and `crates/kernel/src/mesh_deviation.rs`.\n- Added a clean-room STEP fixture (`testdata/models/spline_revolved.step`) containing both a `RATIONAL_B_SPLINE_SURFACE` and a `SURFACE_OF_REVOLUTION`, and pinned it in `crates/kernel/tests/step_agreement.rs` and `crates/kernel/tests/mesh_deviation_bench.rs`.\n- Added continuous between-sample deviation upper bounds in `crates/kernel/src/mesh_bound.rs` (Voronoi closest-point and radial-dip bounds for analytic surfaces) and `crates/kernel/src/mesh_bound_blossom.rs` + `crates/kernel/src/mesh_bound_spline.rs` (de Boor blossom-restricted Peano/Taylor $C^{1,1}$ Hessian and $C^0$ jump bounds for NURBS and revolved surfaces), driven by lazy projection and adaptive 4-way sub-triangle refinement (`MAX_REFINE_DEPTH = 3`, `N = 4 -> 8 -> 16 -> 32`) in `mesh_deviation::measure_within` with `PLAN_MARGIN = 0.5` replanning in `crates/kernel/src/machining_mesh.rs`.\n- Recorded the decision and bench measurements in `docs/decisions/1029-machining-mesh-deviation-bound.md`.\n\n## Cause\nThe machining-mesh seam previously verified planner shortfalls only against synthetic `PlanStats`, judged spline and revolved faces by parametric distance `|S(u, v) - T(u, v)|` (which over-reads non-uniform parameterizations), and checked only 15 discrete barycentric sample points per triangle without bounding sag between samples.\n\n## Tests\n- **Pins (red before fix, green after):**\n  - `between_sample_sag_past_tolerance_is_refused` (failed on `upstream/main` at `0.00490933 <= 0.005`, passes after fix)\n  - `between_sample_spline_sag_past_tolerance_is_refused` (failed on `upstream/main` at `2.29e-16 <= 0.005`, passes after fix)\n  - `non_uniform_spline_parametric_overread_passes_under_projection` (failed on `upstream/main` at `0.175 > 0.005`, passes after fix)\n  - `spline_and_revolved_step_fixture_meshes_within_tolerance` (pins `spline_revolved.step` at `0.005` mm and `0.01` mm where `parametric > 0.01` passes under `projected <= 0.01`)\n  - `provoke_face_left_out_edge_not_sampled_and_lenient`, `provoke_face_capped_refusal`, `provoke_face_capped_note`, `provoke_edge_capped_refusal_and_note`\n- **Mutations (red with guard removed, green after restore):**\n  - Disable `analytic_tri_bound` fast path in `mesh_deviation.rs`: `between_sample_sag_past_tolerance_is_refused` failed (`0.00490933`), passed after restore.\n  - Set `eps = 0.0` in `tri_metrics`: `between_sample_spline_sag_past_tolerance_is_refused` failed (`1.14e-16`), passed after restore.\n  - Disable `ensure_projected` and edge-node projection in `mesh_deviation.rs`: `non_uniform_spline_parametric_overread_passes_under_projection` failed (`0.185938`), passed after restore.\n  - Disable `PLAN_MARGIN` replanning in `machining_mesh.rs`: `spline_and_revolved_step_fixture_meshes_within_tolerance` failed (`0.00500729 > 0.005` on face 2), passed after restore.\n- **Gates:**\n  - `cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main`: passed (`kernel lib` 3/3, `machining_mesh` 7/7, `machining_mesh_bounds` 4/4, `machining_mesh_shortfalls` 4/4, `step_agreement` 18/18, `mesh_deviation_bench` 1 ignored; 206s).\n  - `cargo clippy -p camcraft-kernel --all-targets -- -D warnings`: passed (0 warnings).\n  - `cargo test --release -p camcraft-kernel --test mesh_deviation_bench -- --ignored`: passed (1/1 in 1.15s across all 10 STEP fixtures).\n\n## Goldens moved\nnone\n\n## Not exercised\n- Full `batch` and `release` workspace tiers outside `camcraft-kernel` (no non-kernel crates were modified).\n\n## Overlaps\nnone\n\nEffort: max\nChangelog: project spline/revolved deviation, provoke planner shortfalls, and certify continuous between-sample machining mesh bounds\nFixes #1029\n",
